    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"page\" id=\"page-vine-wraith\">\n  <div class=\"page-header\">\n    <div class=\"page-eyebrow\">Undead / Plant · Skirmisher · CR 7 · XP 2,900</div>\n    <div class=\"page-title\">Vine Wraith</div>\n    <div class=\"page-subtitle\">A wraith rebuilt with living vine threading its necrotic form — semi-transparent, geometrically perfect, deeply wrong</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"lore-box\"><p>\"A shadow is not nothing, dear. It proves that something stands quite near.\" — from Illusion, The Eight Doors of Knowing</p></div>\n  <div class=\"stat-block\">\n    <div class=\"sb-head\">\n      <div class=\"sb-name\">Vine Wraith</div>\n      <div class=\"sb-type\">Medium undead (plant), neutral evil</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">CR 7</span><span class=\"tag\">2,900 XP</span><span class=\"tag tag-purple\">Wraith / Plant</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sb-body\">\n      <div class=\"attr-row\">\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Armor Class</div><div class=\"attr-val\">13</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Hit Points</div><div class=\"attr-val\">97 (13d8 + 39)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Speed</div><div class=\"attr-val\">0 ft, fly 60 ft (hover)</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"core-stats\">\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">STR</div><div class=\"cs-val\">6</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–2)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">DEX</div><div class=\"cs-val\">16</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+3)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">CON</div><div class=\"cs-val\">16</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+3)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">INT</div><div class=\"cs-val\">12</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+1)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">WIS</div><div class=\"cs-val\">14</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+2)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">CHA</div><div class=\"cs-val\">15</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+2)</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"attr-row\">\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Damage Resistances</div><div class=\"attr-val\">acid, cold, fire, lightning, thunder; bludgeoning, piercing, slashing from nonmagical weapons that aren't silvered</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Damage Immunities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">necrotic, poison</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Damage Vulnerabilities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">radiant, slashing (vine component)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Condition Immunities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">charmed, exhaustion, grappled, paralyzed, petrified, poisoned, prone, restrained</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Senses</div><div class=\"attr-val\">darkvision 60 ft, passive Perception 12</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\">Special Traits</div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Incorporeal Movement</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">The vine wraith can move through other creatures and objects as if they were difficult terrain. It takes 5 (1d10) force damage if it ends its turn inside an object. It cannot pass through warded areas or anti-magic fields.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Sunlight Sensitivity</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">While in sunlight, the vine wraith has disadvantage on attack rolls as well as on Wisdom (Perception) checks that rely on sight.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Vine Tether</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">When the vine wraith passes through a creature, that creature must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw or be tethered by spectral vines until the start of the wraith's next turn. A tethered creature's speed is halved and it cannot benefit from the Dash action.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\">Actions</div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Multiattack</div><p class=\"action-desc\">The vine wraith makes two Life Drain attacks.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Life Drain</div><p class=\"action-desc\"><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +6 to hit, reach 5 ft, one creature. <em>Hit:</em> 21 (4d8 + 3) necrotic damage. The target must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw or its hit point maximum is reduced by the damage dealt until it finishes a long rest. A target reduced to 0 hit points by this attack dies.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Create Specter</div><p class=\"action-desc\">The vine wraith targets a humanoid within 10 ft that died in the last minute. That humanoid's spirit rises as a Specter (see Monster Manual) under Diane Clearwater's control. The specter's form shows faint vine threading through its translucent body.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Illusion of Nature <em>(1/day)</em></div><p class=\"action-desc\">The vine wraith casts major image (no concentration required) of a tranquil natural scene — a forest glade, a riverside, a garden. Creatures that succeed on a DC 14 Investigation check realize the scene is false. Creatures that fail become convinced they are safe and must succeed on a DC 14 Wisdom save to take hostile action while in the illusion's area.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
